\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Immortal, invisible, God only wise,
\par In light inaccessible hid from our eyes,
\par Most blessed, most glorious, the Ancient of Days,
\par Almighty, victorious, Thy great name we praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Unresting, unhasting, and silent as light,
\par Nor wanting, nor wasting, Thou rulest in might;
\par Thy jusice like mountains high soaring above
\par Thy clouds which are fountains of goodness and love
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To all life Thou givest -to both great and small;
\par In all life Thou livest, the true life of all;
\par We blossom an flourish as leaves on the tree,
\par And wither and perish-but nought changeth Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Great Father of Glory, pure Father of light,
\par Thine angels adore Thee, all veiling their sight;
\par All laud we would render; O help us to see:
\par 'Tis only the splendour of light hideth Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Immortal, invisible, God only wise,
\par In light inaccessible hid from our eyes,
\par Most blessed, most glorious, the Ancient of Days,
\par Almighty, victorious, Thy great name we praise. 
\par                                                                 Amen. 
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
